  "title": "Cervical Artificial Disc Arthroplasty",
  "jurisdiction": "CMS Hospital Outpatient Prior Authorization (42 CFR \u00a7 419.80)",
  "effective_date": "2021-07-01",
  "category": "Spine Surgery / Neurosurgery",
  "description": "CMS prior authorization for cervical artificial disc arthroplasty (cervical TDR). Requires single-level or two-level cervical radiculopathy or myelopathy confirmed on MRI/CT, failure of at least 6 weeks of non-operative conservative therapy, and absence of severe facet joint arthrosis.",
